@startuml
title Domain Model Excerpt — US031 (User Registration)

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor<<AggregateRoot>> #D0C8F8
    BorderColor<<AggregateRoot>> #534AB7
    BackgroundColor<<ValueObject>> #FAE8C0
    BorderColor<<ValueObject>> #854F0B
    BackgroundColor<<FrameworkEntity>> #C8F0D0
    BorderColor<<FrameworkEntity>> #1A7A34
}

package "EAPLI Framework (Authentication Layer)" {
    class SystemUser <<FrameworkEntity>> {
        + username : Username
        + password : Password
        + roles : RoleSet
        + active : boolean
        + isActive(): boolean
    }
}

package "AlSafe Domain (User Management Aggregate)" {
    class User <<AggregateRoot>> {
        + email : EmailAddress
        + name : String
        + phoneNumber : String
        + staffNumber : String
        + active : boolean
        + role : String
        + securityClearanceExpiry : LocalDate
        + nextSkillsAssessmentDate : LocalDate
    }

    class EmailAddress <<ValueObject>> {
        + address : String
    }

    User "1" *-- "1" EmailAddress
}

SystemUser .. User : linked by email\n(username = email)

note right of User
  Domain invariants:
  - email unique, valid format, valid AISafe domain
  - name not blank
  - phoneNumber exactly 9 digits, unique
  - staffNumber not blank, unique
  - securityClearanceExpiry must be future
  - nextSkillsAssessmentDate = today + 5yr (auto)
  - active = true on creation
  - role = "BACKOFFICE_OPERATOR" on creation
  Note: password and authentication
  managed by SystemUser (framework)
end note

note left of SystemUser
  Managed by EAPLI Framework.
  Stores credentials and roles.
  Created via UserManagementService.
end note
@enduml
